{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0b48078e-090e-8482-b161-c5fa1f4e6cd0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T11:22:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:15:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Rosa. Good morning to you, and I hope your Monday is going well. My name is Lidia Lopes. I am sorry to trouble you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:16:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all, Ms. Lopes. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:16:20-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you are very kind. I am a homeowner here in Newport, and I am calling, um, I am not sure if I have reached the correct office. It is about an animal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What kind of animal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:16:42-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A fox. I saw a fox this morning, just a little while ago. In the daylight, you understand, not at night. It was walking across the yard very slowly, like it was not afraid of anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:17:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Did it come near you, or did it do anything aggressive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:17:08-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it did not come to me. I was at the kitchen window. But it stayed there a long time, maybe five minutes, and it was not running away when I knocked on the glass. This is not normal, I think. I have always heard that a fox is for the night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:17:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, usually they are. Did it look sick to you? Stumbling, thin, patchy fur, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, maybe a little thin. The fur, I could not say well. It was walking, how do I say, a little crooked? Not straight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's worth reporting. Animal control handles that, and I can take the information and pass it along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, thank you, thank you. Because I am worried, Rosa. There are children nearby. The school bus stops at the corner, and the neighbors have two small ones who play outside all the time. And in the afternoon they all come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:18:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understandable. And you're not giving me an address, so do you want to tell me where you saw it? Or is that something you'd rather not say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I am sorry. I would prefer not to say my house number on the telephone, if that is possible. I can say it is near the corner where the bus stops, and the fox went toward the back of the yards."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Which street is the bus stop on? Just the street is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly I am not comfortable to say. I am sorry. Can you not just tell them a fox, in the daytime, acting strange, in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can note that. It'll be harder for them to respond without a location, but I'll write down everything you've told me and a callback number. Can I get one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:19:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one seven six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:19:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-six. Got it. And it's Lidia, L-I-D-I-A, Lopes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. L-O-P-E-S. You are very careful, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:20:01-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, in the meantime, keep the kids and any pets inside if you can, and don't try to approach it or feed it. If it comes at anybody, or if it's right there acting aggressive, call the police dispatch line right away rather than waiting on us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Yes, I understand. I will not go near. Should I tell the neighbors? The mother next door, she is a very good person, but I do not want to frighten her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think it's fine to give her a heads up. Just say there's a fox out in the daytime and to keep an eye on the kids when they're out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:20:58-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will do this. Forgive me, I am a little nervous. I am standing here, and I already have my keys and my wallet by the door, because I must go and meet the bus at the corner. I want to be there before the children."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Go ahead and walk over, just stay aware of what's around you. If you see it again, don't go toward it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:21:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And someone will call me, you think? About the fox?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send this over to animal control today, and they'd be the ones to call you back. I can't tell you exactly when, but it's going in now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:21:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is fine. Thank you. May I ask one more thing? If I see it again tomorrow, should I call you or the other number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call us again for a report, that's fine, and I'll add it to the notes. But if it seems aggressive or it's close to someone, use the police line. Don't wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand now. You have been so helpful, Rosa. God bless you and your family, and have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Lopes. Take care out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:22:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye, goodbye."
    }
  ],
